window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>It’s forbidden for me to fight, but some rules are meant to be broken…</b></p> <p>No one expects an orphaned servant girl like me to amount to anything, least of all me. But on my first shift, I’m fiercer than even the toughest wolves in the pack. I capture the attention of the royal brothers, who invite me to join training camp with them—except it’s strictly no girls allowed. </p> <p>So I pretend to be one of them and tell them I’m a lost ‘prince’, because females are meant to be submissive and fighter wolves like me are unheard of. Not this she-wolf. Even the eldest brother, Prince Lex, who constantly taunts me when I’m a servant girl, welcomes me into their royal band of brothers.</p> <p>But when my secret comes out, Lex looks at me in an entirely new way—and I think I like it. Only there’s not going to be a happily ever after for me. I’m to be wed to the cruellest alpha of the most vicious pack in the land as a peace offering from our side.</p> <p>And when I discover the reason behind why I’ve been chosen, it will change everything...</p>"; 
